    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to Your Dream Home!\r\nThis beautiful 3-bedroom home perfectly blends modern, energy-efficient living with elegant style. Located in the highly sought-after Hawthorns development, this property is finished to a high standard throughout. Featuring tasteful, neutral décor, it offers a warm, light-filled, and welcoming atmosphere that is entirely turn-key for its next owner.  Holding an enviable A2 BER rating, this home is equipped with a state-of-the-art air-to-water heating system. This ensures low running costs and premium comfort, while also qualifying buyers for lower-interest Green Mortgage rates."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway:  1.14m x 6.95m Tile floor, featuring bright, neutral tones.  Alarm pad\r\n\r\nLiving Room: 3.84m x 4.25m A bright, expansive family living space designed for comfort and modern entertainment.  Tile  floor.  Floor-to-ceiling window providing excellent natural light and view to green area at front.\r\n\r\nOpenplan Kitchen/ Dining: 4.89m x 4.75m  Fitted kitchen with tile surround. Tile floor. This modern space features integrated appliances, ample room  for family dining and entertaining. Patio doors to garden with pergola.\r\n\r\nUtility:  1.14m x 1.87m.  Plumbed for washer/dryer.  Tile floor.  Fitted units  \r\n\r\nGuest WC:  1.48m x 1.32m  Tile floor, WHB & WC\r\n\r\nCarpeted stairs with wood floor landing \r\n\r\nBedroom One(Master):   4.38m x 2.97m.  Wood floor.   Fitted wardrobes.  Ensuite and walk-in wardrobe off.  Overlooking front green  \r\nEnsuite:\t2.17m x 1.75m.  Tiled, pump shower, WC & WHB.  \r\n\r\nBedroom Two:  2.78.m x 2.01m.  Wood floor.   \r\n\r\nBedroom Three:   2.78.m x 2.69m Wood floor.   \r\n\r\nBathroom:\t  1.01m x 1.46m. Tiled, bath,  shower, WC & WHB."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Features\r\nSpacious Living: Layout designed to maximize natural light.\r\nPremium Parking: Large private front driveway finished with a premium paved cobble-lock surface, providing dedicated parking for 2 vehicles.\r\nA2 Rated Home Qualifying For Green Mortgage with Air To Water Heating System\r\nGated Side Access To Private Rear Garden with Pergola to rear – ideal for outdoor entertainment and chilling all year round.\r\nNot over looked to rear and overlooking green area to front\r\n\r\nLocation and Amenities\t\r\nPrime position within The Hawthorns, offering unparalleled convenience too:\r\nEducation & Healthcare: Located within easy reach of Tullamore General Hospital and the Educate Together National School.\r\nTown Centre Amenities: Tullamore—with its vibrant selection of shops, cafes, restaurants, and pubs—is just a short walk away.\r\nTransport Links: Commuting is effortless with quick access to Tullamore Train Station and the M6 Motorway, providing excellent connectivity to both Dublin and Galway."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A2"
      },
